  <div class="pl-cards">
    <details class="pl-card-d">
      <summary>ArticleListItem.kt — remove dead animation, palette state, and wrap snippet parse</summary>
      <div class="pl-card">
        <p>Delete the <code>rememberInfiniteTransition</code> / <code>angle</code> block (lines 111–120) and its six animation imports. Drop <code>dominantColor</code>/<code>vibrantColor</code> state vars, <code>onPaletteExtracted</code> lambda, and <code>DisposableEffect</code> palette reset. Wrap the bare <code>HtmlCompat.fromHtml</code> call in <code>remember(article.snippet){ }</code>. Replace the <code>remember(article.itemId)</code> + two LaunchedEffect tag pattern with a single <code>remember(article.tagsString, tags){ }</code> that builds the map directly.</p>
